//These codesystem will be removed after all medical forms codes are collected and added to IG
CodeSystem: FormsObservationValuesCS
Id: forms-observation-values-cs
Title: "Forms Observation Values"
Description: "Local coded values used for observations in medical forms."
* insert OriginalCodeSystemDraft(forms-observation-values-cs)

